We've been doing this the whole time.

568
00:48:58,386 --> 00:49:01,286
あーやが、あーやの手が止まらなくて。
Anya's hands wouldn't stop moving.

569
00:49:01,786 --> 00:49:08,786
やめろ！やめろ！私のまねをやめてよ！
Stop it! Stop copying me!

570
00:49:09,786 --> 00:49:13,286
ってことでね、なんでこの曲を選んだの？
So, why did you choose this song?

571
00:49:13,586 --> 00:49:17,286
えー、だって、わためちゃんにカッコいい曲似合うからね。
Well, because cool songs suit Watame-chan!

572
00:49:17,786 --> 00:49:22,286
うれしーん、え、大丈夫だった？こんなやりたい放題させてくれて。
I'm so happy. Are you sure it was okay to let me do whatever I wanted?

573
00:49:22,386 --> 00:49:26,786
いやいやいやいや、これしか無いやろ！これしかないよな、もう。
No, no, no, this was the only choice! This was definitely it.

574
00:49:27,286 --> 00:49:32,286
ブロックしてこぜ！この後もね！ブロックしていこーぜ！
Let's rock on! Let's keep rocking after this too!

575
00:49:33,786 --> 00:49:37,786
うん、ねえ、私たちもね、あの、気づいたんだけど、
Yeah, you know, we actually realized something...

576
00:49:37,986 --> 00:49:41,786
え？気づいたことがありました。なんと？
Huh? We realized something. What is it?

577
00:49:42,286 --> 00:49:43,786
顔が似てるんだよな！
Our faces look similar!

578
00:49:43,986 --> 00:49:46,786
え？似てる？でかいってことか？
Eh? Similar? You mean big?

579
00:49:46,786 --> 00:49:50,286
いや似てるよね、ほら、見て。ほらほら、似てるよね。
No, they look similar, look. Look, look, they look similar, right?

580
00:49:51,786 --> 00:49:55,786
いや、似てる、で、瞳の色もね、同じだし、紫色だしね。
Well, they're similar, and the eye color is the same too, purple.

581
00:49:56,286 --> 00:50:01,786
ね、顔でかいし！顔でけえ！顔でけえな！
Right, our faces are big! Faces are so big! So big!

582
00:50:03,314 --> 00:50:07,044
もうどっちがでかいのかもうわかんないよ。
I can't even tell which one is bigger anymore.

583
00:50:07,794 --> 00:50:08,744
まあね。
True.

584
00:50:09,744 --> 00:50:13,044
ありがとうね、もう来てくれて嬉しい。
Thank you so much for coming, I'm so happy.

585
00:50:13,044 --> 00:50:13,994
こちらこそだよ。
Likewise!

586
00:50:14,094 --> 00:50:16,594
また遊ぼね！また遊ぼう！
Let's hang out again! Let's play again!

587
00:50:16,594 --> 00:50:18,194
また遊びましょう、またね！もう！
Let's play again, see you! Jeez!

588
00:50:18,894 --> 00:50:23,194
これも、これもぜひね、あのやりたいよね、いつか。やりたい！
We definitely gotta do this sometime too, right? I want to!

589
00:50:23,194 --> 00:50:26,994
こういうゲームあるよね、多分。こういうゲームあるんじゃない？
Games like this exist, right? Probably?

590
00:50:27,094 --> 00:50:28,594
ね、あるある！
Yeah, they do!

591
00:50:28,694 --> 00:50:31,094
やろうよ！いつでも呼んで！来てくれてありがとう！
Let's do it! Call me anytime! Thanks for coming!

592
00:50:31,194 --> 00:50:33,094
おめでとう！おめでとう！
Congratulations! Congratulations!

593
00:50:33,094 --> 00:50:38,094
おめでとう！おめでとう！おめでとう！
Congratulations! Congratulations! Congratulations!

594
00:50:50,094 --> 00:50:51,094
あい！
Aye!

595
00:50:51,094 --> 00:50:56,594
おー！
Oh!

596
00:50:57,194 --> 00:51:00,094
うわ！キリト！アグレージェリー3D！3D！
Woah! Kureiji Ollie's 3D! 3D!

597
00:51:03,094 --> 00:51:08,094
オッパイイェーボー！オッパイイェーボー！
Oppai yeah bo! Oppai yeah bo!

598
00:51:14,094 --> 00:51:17,594
おや！リバーシブルとは？あ、リバーシブル？
Oh? What's reversible? Ah, reversible?

599
00:51:18,194 --> 00:51:28,094
なんかみんなのセリフ、サポートコメントとかスーパーチャット、なんかもっときらめくね。
It feels like everyone's supportive comments and super chats are sparkling even more.

600
00:51:28,094 --> 00:51:36,594
オッパイイェーボー！オッパイイェーボー！
Oppai yeah bo! Oppai yeah bo!

601
00:51:37,094 --> 00:51:40,894
え、By the way、みんな知ってるか、これはロゴオパ？
Oh, by the way, guys, do you know what logo this is?

602
00:51:41,094 --> 00:51:45,594
イニイニイニ！ちょっとちょっと待って！ロゴオパだよ！
Ini, ini, ini! Wait, wait, wait! It's a logo!

603
00:51:46,094 --> 00:51:50,894
ロゴオパだよ、じゃん！
It's a logo, ta-da!

604
00:51:51,094 --> 00:51:57,094
あら、TV？あら、TV？
Huh? TV? Huh? TV?

605
00:52:01,094 --> 00:52:08,094
アニャメフィッサ！3Dおめでとう！
Anya Melfissa! Happy 3D!

606
00:52:21,094 --> 00:52:24,094
Ollie, damn those boobs!

607
00:52:43,094 --> 00:52:50,094
Kureiji Ollie, bagaimana tadi? Kita... joget dan nyanyi—enggak nyanyi sih, joget tapi ke-identity crisis.
Kureiji Ollie, how was it? We danced and sang—well, didn't sing, just danced—with an identity crisis.

608
00:52:51,094 --> 00:52:54,594
How was that? Wah, baru tau loh bisa nge-DJ.
How was that? Wow, I never knew you could DJ.

609
00:52:55,094 --> 00:53:03,094
Salah satu my hidden skills, well, I've been living for like hundreds of years. Dan Pavolia Reine bagaimana tadi?
One of my hidden skills, well, I've been living for like hundreds of years. And Pavolia Reine, how was it?

610
00:53:05,094 --> 00:53:18,094
Tadi? Kita ngapain aja ya, langsung? Saking hartenya lupa kita ngapain. Kita nge-DJ dan berjoget.
Just now? What did we even do? We were having so much fun we forgot. We DJ'd and danced.

611
00:53:20,094 --> 00:53:29,094
By the way itu udah berkilau! Kaca saya, kaca saya, makasih! Thank you, thank you, terima kasih!
By the way, it's already sparkling! My glass! My glass! Thanks! Thank you, thank you, terima kasih!

612
00:53:30,094 --> 00:53:37,094
Ya udah berarti gitu aja ya? Hah? Enggak, bukan gitu dong!
So that's it then? Huh? No, that's not it!

613
00:53:38,094 --> 00:53:49,094
Kita kan, ini udah di-stage bertiga, kita mau nyanyi dan nge-DJ bareng!
We're all three on stage together now, we're gonna sing and DJ together!

614
00:53:50,094 --> 00:54:08,094
Yes, kita atur formasi dulu... Listen to our cover song, I guess.
Yes, let's arrange our formation first... Listen to our cover song, I guess.

615
00:54:18,041 --> 00:54:19,921
ガラクタばかりを集めて
Collecting only scraps and junk,

616
00:54:19,921 --> 00:54:22,441
ボロ切れひとつを被せた
draping a single tattered rag over them,

617
00:54:22,441 --> 00:54:24,921
醜い形をしたレプリカ
a replica shaped in an ugly form.

618
00:54:25,351 --> 00:54:27,881
誰かが紡いだ言葉を
Words spun by someone,

619
00:54:27,881 --> 00:54:30,371
誰かが奏でた音色を
tones played by someone,

620
00:54:30,371 --> 00:54:33,921
歪にコラージュした偽物
a fake distortedly collaged together.

621
00:54:34,911 --> 00:54:40,101
一番最初はベールの中革新的な少年の愛情が
At the very beginning, inside the veil, a revolutionary boy's affection

622
00:54:40,101 --> 00:54:43,391
僕ら気付いたらもう見えなくなる
before we knew it, becomes invisible to us.

623
00:54:43,391 --> 00:54:45,761
おもちゃを無くした子供が泣いている
A child who lost their toy is crying.

624
00:54:45,761 --> 00:54:48,411
どうしようだろうか？あのスポットライトに
What should we do? Underneath that spotlight,

625
00:54:48,411 --> 00:54:50,461
照らされているその背中は
that back being illuminated

626
00:54:50,461 --> 00:54:53,141
またこの手から遠ざかっていく
is drifting further away from these hands once again.

627
00:54:53,141 --> 00:55:02,141
あなたみたいになれやれなくて
Not being able to become like you,

628
00:55:03,526 --> 00:55:05,412
あつい雲を引っ裂いて 月明かり足下を照らす
Ripping apart thick clouds, moonlight illuminates our feet.

629
00:55:05,446 --> 00:55:09,342
渇いた心は満たされないまま
My thirsty heart remains unfulfilled.

630
00:55:09,736 --> 00:55:15,252
一人になって一人になってくすんだ夢を見つめ続けてしまった
Being alone, I kept staring at faded dreams.

631
00:55:15,846 --> 00:55:18,942
僕たちは
We...

632
00:55:19,436 --> 00:55:25,912
巡りだって彷徨ぎだってその心は絶えず光るには僕だけの光があった
Wandering and straying, in order to shine constantly, there was a light only mine.

633
00:55:34,826 --> 00:55:39,202
足りないのなんだってんだろう 髪々に聞いた木陰で
What could be lacking? In the shade of trees where I asked.

634
00:55:39,206 --> 00:55:42,542
黄昏の弓矢に口止めされた
I was silenced by the arrow of twilight.

635
00:55:43,636 --> 00:55:47,782
初めて知っていたんだよ 忘れたふりをもしてんだよ
I knew it from the start, pretending to have forgotten.

636
00:55:47,786 --> 00:55:51,282
もらい物の剣を抱きしめている
I am holding tight to a borrowed sword.

637
00:55:52,606 --> 00:55:56,882
何回かいやも失望だったの一その身にも過ちを犯してしまいたいと
How many times was it disappointment, wanting to commit a sin in that very body?

638
00:56:01,056 --> 00:56:06,602
究極最後には何も残らない 愛を紡いでも名前を消していく
Ultimately, nothing is left; even as we weave love, our names fade away.

639
00:56:08,426 --> 00:56:13,312
どうしてだろうこの胸の奥にこびり付いている
Why is it that deep inside this chest it clings—

640
00:56:13,316 --> 00:56:18,032
冬の夜の七日間に似た孤独を
a loneliness resembling the seven days of a winter night?

641
00:56:18,336 --> 00:56:20,792
あなたはきっと知りもしないで
You surely without ever knowing—

642
00:56:20,796 --> 00:56:22,402
一人星を見ていた
watching the stars alone.

643
00:56:22,406 --> 00:56:26,402
赤い目の僕に気も留めないまま
Remaining indifferent to me with my red eyes.

644
00:56:26,906 --> 00:56:32,302
隣に立ったあなたは遠くて くすんだ夢も見えなくなってしまって
Standing beside me, you were so far away that I could no longer see our faded dreams.

645
00:56:33,026 --> 00:56:35,802
それをも追い続けて
Continuing to chase even that.

646
00:56:36,366 --> 00:56:42,972
世物のだって本当だって もし振り返れば そこにはぼやけた記憶があった
Whether fake or real, if I looked back, there was a blurred memory there.

647
00:56:44,536 --> 00:56:48,152
罪悪と化したアイロニ クリシェを抜け出したいのに
Wanting to break free from the irony and cliché turned into guilt,

648
00:56:48,476 --> 00:56:52,142
また誰かの焼き直し？
just a retelling by someone else again?

649
00:56:52,426 --> 00:56:57,892
数々の星のかけらたち 沈みゆく夕せいに 無慈悲な月の光
Countless fragments of stars sinking into the fading twilight, the merciless moonlight.

650
00:57:01,476 --> 00:57:05,562
アイデンティティーのまかし
A phantom of identity.

651
00:57:10,436 --> 00:57:15,232
盗んでもでも愛が欲しい
Even if I steal it, I want love.

652
00:57:17,736 --> 00:57:21,892
羊のような雲浮かぶ昼過ぎ
Past noon, with sheep-like clouds floating by,

653
00:57:22,266 --> 00:57:25,802
懐かしい歌が風に揺れている
a nostalgic song sways in the wind.

654
00:57:26,556 --> 00:57:32,152
新たな恋人を知ってもらったことは 今でも忘れないように書き留めてる同じことを
To ensure I never forget even now that you learned of my new lover, I write down the same thing.

655
00:57:32,606 --> 00:57:35,462
あなたみたいになりやしたくて あの日を追いかけて
Wanting to become like you, chasing after that day.

656
00:57:35,726 --> 00:57:43,392
渇いた心は満たされないまま 時間が経って時間が経って振り返る時目をそますように覗う僕たちは
My thirsty heart remaining unfulfilled, as time passes and I look back, we gaze as if averting our eyes.

657
00:57:46,486 --> 00:57:54,742
忘れたってだってさ 冷めの夢を ぜいたく先には僕だけの光がずっと
Even if forgotten, waking dreams— ahead of that luxury, my own light is always...

658
00:58:18,517 --> 00:58:26,897
ああ、お疲れ！みんな！うーん、ギターほろろ、歌う、一緒にさ、で、DJ一緒。
Ah, good job everyone! Um, playing guitar, singing together, and DJing together.

659
00:58:28,402 --> 00:58:37,902
Okay, we sang Gekkou, Reine and I sang Gekkou. How was it? It's one of my favorite songs, and I'm so happy I got to sing it with them.

660
00:58:39,207 --> 00:58:45,507
まあ、いろいろありましたね。カナタ先輩とね、あの、一緒にドロンしたし、まあ私はドロンしてなかったんですけど。
Well, a lot happened. Kanata-senpai and I did a ninja vanish together... well, I actually didn't ninja vanish.

661
00:58:45,507 --> 00:58:51,907
でも、ワタメちゃんともね、あの、ベースもね、もう、こんなにもね、あの、引きましたね。
But with Watame-chan too, you know, the bass was really played like this.

662
00:58:52,207 --> 00:58:59,907
いやあ、楽しかった！で、IDにキセーと一緒にDJ、そして、え、Gekkou歌いましたと、いかがでしたでしょうか？ How was it everyone?
Man, it was fun! And with ID 1st gen, DJing together, and then singing Gekkou, how was it everyone?

663
00:59:01,907 --> 00:59:09,907
まあ、この後もね、いろいろまだあるので、After this, there's still some stuff that I want to show you guys. Oh my goodness!
Well, after this there's still more to come, so after this there's still some stuff that I want to show you guys. Oh my goodness!

664
00:59:10,507 --> 00:59:23,507
あれ？あれ？ん？ What is it? What's that sound? Hello? Wait, what? What is that? Something is flying? Wait, what? Huh?
Huh? Huh? What? What is that sound? Hello? Wait, what? What is that? Something is flying? Wait, what? Huh?

665
00:59:23,507 --> 00:59:32,507
か、,なんか、見たこと、ファミリア、 guys? あれ？あれ？知る顔だぞ？え？
Wh-, it looks familiar, guys? Huh? Huh? I know that face? Eh?

666
00:59:32,507 --> 00:59:44,507
ちょっと、ちょっと、み、見てみたい。あれ？ちょっと近く、近くから見てみたい。あれ？ Is that? Wait, is that YAGOO? Is that YAGOO?
Wait, wait, I wanna see. Huh? Let's look closer. Huh? Is that? Wait, is that YAGOO? Is that YAGOO?

667
00:59:44,507 --> 00:59:51,507
あれ？あ、YAGOOじゃん、みんな！ YAGOOの、YAGOOにも愛音同コチャック？ YAGOO本気じゃん！
Huh? Ah, it's YAGOO, everyone! YAGOO, YAGOO is even flying? YAGOO is for real!

668
00:59:51,507 --> 00:59:55,507
YAGOO！YAGOOさん、こっち、こっち！
YAGOO! YAGOO-san, over here, over here!

669
00:59:56,402 --> 01:00:03,402
YAGOO！YAGOOの、みせまえ？ YAGOO！ほんとらんや！
YAGOO! YAGOO's... YAGOO! For real!

670
01:00:07,121 --> 01:00:12,281
あれ 一体 何が… あれ? YAGOOさんですよね?
Huh? What on earth... Huh? It's YAGOO, right?

671
01:00:12,821 --> 01:00:14,301
飛べるんですか?
Can you fly?

672
01:00:14,841 --> 01:00:18,321
そうですね、アニャさん、3Dお披露目おめでとうございます。
That's right. Anya-san, congratulations on your 3D reveal.

673
01:00:18,821 --> 01:00:24,381
ええっ! もしかして今日わざわざここまで? ありがとうございます!
Eh?! Did you actually come all the way here today? Thank you so much!

674
01:00:24,381 --> 01:00:35,141
せっかくなので、まあ我々ホロライブID 2期生はね、3Dお披露目をしたわけなんですけれども、YAGOOさんのご感想をお聞きしたいのですが、いただいてもよろしいですか?
Since we have the chance, I'd love to hear your thoughts, YAGOO. May I?

675
01:00:35,681 --> 01:00:42,641
ホロライブインドネシアの皆さんも、1期生に続いて2期生の皆さんも、3Dお披露目ができてとてもよかったと思います。
I think it's wonderful that both Gen 1 and Gen 2 could have their 3D reveals.

676
01:00:43,441 --> 01:00:48,601
おおっ! あれっ、ありがとうございます! あれ、大丈夫かな、これYouTube的に。大丈夫かな?
Whoa! Oh, thank you! Wait, is this okay for YouTube? Will it be fine?

677
01:00:49,741 --> 01:00:53,781
まあ、そうですね、ありがとうございます!
Well, um, yeah, thank you very much!

678
01:00:53,781 --> 01:00:59,801
最後に、えーっと、今日の晩ご飯何を食べたか教えていただきたいです。
Lastly, um, could you tell us what you had for dinner today?

679
01:00:59,881 --> 01:01:02,741
今日は奥さんの手料理を食べました。
Today, I had my wife's home-cooked meal.

680
01:01:03,181 --> 01:01:11,161
ほお、幸せそうですね、声から。いやあ、ありがとうございました! 以上です、お帰り気をつけてくださーい!
Ohh, you sound so happy! Well, thank you very much! Have a safe trip home!

681
01:01:15,901 --> 01:01:23,161
ばいばい! YAGOO、YAGOOさん! ばいばい! YAGOOさん、ありがとう! 来てくれて! Thank you!
Bye-bye! YAGOO, YAGOO-san! Thank you for coming! Thank you!

682
01:01:25,701 --> 01:01:31,461
あー、Oh my god! I can't believe YAGOO actually visited!
Ah, oh my god! I can't believe YAGOO actually visited!

683
01:01:31,461 --> 01:01:36,501
Gila, dari YAGOO sampai datang! Gila banget, sich, guys!
Crazy, YAGOO actually came! That's insane, guys!

684
01:01:36,801 --> 01:01:49,041
Anyways, I still have like some more things to show to you guys. So, let's go to the next stage! いや、次のステージに移動しようかな! 次は!
Anyways, I still have more to show you. Let's go to the next stage! Next is...

685
01:01:49,741 --> 01:01:52,041
IDアリーナだー!
ID Arena!

686
01:02:01,401 --> 01:02:07,941
うわ、ぎゃ、ステージ替わり! わあ、IDアリーナの、アニャ・メルフィッサどん! ステージ誰ほー!
Whoa, stage change! It's Anya Melfissa's ID Arena stage! Whose stage is next? Woo!

687
01:02:08,861 --> 01:02:22,701
Welcome to ID Arena, Anya Melfissa version! This is my ID Arena stage, and I will be singing a special song. あく、ここに、あかん、歌うや、 गाइस、歌う、あっぱ!
Welcome to ID Arena, Anya Melfissa version! And I will be singing a special song.

688
01:02:23,861 --> 01:02:51,041
Well, my, my original song! で、ここで何するかと言うと、ええ、1曲ね、歌います。何の曲なのかね、あの、私のあのオリジナル曲、初のオリジナル曲、My first original song, please listen to it. Unreal Veil!
Well, my original song! My first original song, please listen to it. Unreal Veil!

689
01:03:11,491 --> 01:03:16,431
どっからどう見ても品行方正
No matter how you look at it, I'm well-behaved,

690
01:03:16,431 --> 01:03:20,131
いったって真面目でいいじゃんね
acting earnest is totally fine, right?

691
01:03:20,131 --> 01:03:22,131
メガネかけ歩く天真爛漫
Wearing glasses, walking innocently,

692
01:03:22,131 --> 01:03:24,311
本当の自分かわからない?
Don't even know my true self?

693
01:03:24,311 --> 01:03:26,291
マスクをつけて隠してる
Putting on a mask to hide it all,

694
01:03:26,291 --> 01:03:28,411
泣きそうな顔全部隠してる
hiding every tearful face away.

695
01:03:28,411 --> 01:03:31,731
夜が来るたびに思い出してる
Remembering it every time night comes,

696
01:03:31,731 --> 01:03:35,131
空駆ける秀麗で隠してく
hiding it with soaring grace.

697
01:03:35,131 --> 01:03:36,951
もううんざりかい?
Are you sick of it already?

698
01:03:37,211 --> 01:03:40,211
アンリアル絡まって叫いじゃおうぜ
Let's tangle in the unreal and shout it out!

699
01:03:40,211 --> 01:03:42,651
隠してた本当の自分を
